      <activity id="a1fb75b3-de27-506d-ab2d-0e595626277e" activityNameId="1fdce7d3-83c8-58db-99f6-3409f81f1b37" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Welding, arc, steel</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Welding, arc, steel
Different arc welding technologies can have verry different emissions. Only to be used for the technology describes or as a rough proxy if welding is not important in the system considered.;
Synonyms: MAG, MIG; 
UUID: a757475d-7631-3166-a856-6c72e3804a19
Includes the MAG-welding of non alloyed steel and the transports of the filler rod and the protective gas to the place of use. 
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: MAG-welding of unalloyed steel with 83% Ar, 13% CO2 and 4% O2 protective gas and a wire consumption of 0.0536 kg/m.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a757475d-7631-3166-a856-6c72e3804a19.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
